// "More in" links: the other pages in this article's hub group.
const HERE = "/best-treadmills-under-700/";
const HUB = SECTIONS.find((s) => s.slug === "price");
const GROUP = HUB?.groups.find((g) => g.pages.some((p) => p.url === HERE)) ?? HUB?.groups[0];
const MORE = (GROUP?.pages ?? []).filter((p) => p.url !== HERE).slice(0, 6);
---

<Layout
  title={`${title} | Treadmill Reviews USA`}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-11-24",
    modifiedTime: "2026-11-24",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "best treadmill under 700",
      "treadmill under $700",
      "treadmill under $700 with 12% or higher incline",
      "treadmill under 700 with incline",
      "12 mph treadmill under 700",
      "best treadmill under 700 dollars",
      "folding treadmill under 700",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Best Overall: Sunny Health & Fitness SF-T723016", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/price/">Treadmills by Budget</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Buying Guide</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Best Treadmills Under $700 12% Incline or More, and 12 mph</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        The best treadmill under $700 for most homes is the Sunny Health & Fitness SF-T723016: 0.6 to 12 mph, 12% auto incline, a 20 by 53-inch deck and a 300 lb limit for about $646 on Amazon. Aeriflo’s X-T510A adds 20% incline at 12 mph on a 55-inch deck for about $627, and three others cover heavy users, a tighter budget and the longest motor warranty.
      </p>
      <p class="ed-answer"><strong>Short answer.</strong> Best Overall: <a href="#sunny-sf-t723016">Sunny Health & Fitness SF-T723016</a>. Best for Steep Incline: <a href="#aeriflo-x-t510a">Aeriflo X-T510A Treadmill</a>. Highest Capacity: <a href="#wellfit-15-heavy-duty">WELLFIT Auto Incline Treadmill, 15% Heavy Duty</a>.</p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 24, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">How we chose: makers’ published specifications and manuals, independent reviews and owner reports, cross-checked. Not tested hands-on.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We may earn a commission when you buy through the links below. It costs you nothing and never decides a ranking. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#sunny-sf-t723016"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zEW-U7bEL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Sunny Health &amp; Fitness SF-T723016" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#aeriflo-x-t510a"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HmqiefNRL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Aeriflo X-T510A Treadmill" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#schwinn-810"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41q5bpFisiL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Schwinn 810" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Sunny Health &amp; Fitness SF-T723016 · Aeriflo X-T510A Treadmill · Schwinn 810</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          The $600 to $700 band is where Amazon treadmills start to offer two things together that
          cheaper machines usually make you choose between: a powered incline of 12% or more, and a
          top speed of 12 mph. Below about $600, most folding treadmills stop at 10 mph or less, and
          many of those with steep incline are walking-focused machines with short decks. Spend a
          little more and the same listings start to pair 12 mph with 12, 15 or even 20% incline on a
          deck 20 inches wide. This page is built around that combination, because it is what most
          people searching at this price are after. The five picks below each do a different job:
          best all-rounder, steepest incline at running speed, highest weight limit, lowest price for
          12 mph and longest motor warranty. Every figure comes from the Amazon listing or the
          maker’s own page, with the date we saw it.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
          <h2>Our top picks:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Overall:</span> <a href="#sunny-sf-t723016">Sunny Health & Fitness SF-T723016</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best for Steep Incline:</span> <a href="#aeriflo-x-t510a">Aeriflo X-T510A Treadmill</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[1].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Highest Capacity:</span> <a href="#wellfit-15-heavy-duty">WELLFIT Auto Incline Treadmill, 15% Heavy Duty</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[2].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Budget:</span> <a href="#orasant-18-wide">ORASANT 18" Wide Belt Incline Treadmill</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[3].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Longest Warranty:</span> <a href="#schwinn-810">Schwinn 810</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[4].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="In this roundup">
          <h2>In this roundup</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#quick-picks">The short answer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#picks">The 5 picks</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how-we-chose">How We Chose These Treadmills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#incline-and-speed">Incline and 12 mph</a></li>
            <li><a href="#what-700-buys">What $700 buys</a></li>
            <li><a href="#motor-claims">Motor claims</a></li>
            <li><a href="#deck-and-weight">Deck and weight limit</a></li>
            <li><a href="#brand-and-warranty">Brand and warranty</a></li>
            <li><a href="#space-and-noise">Space and noise</a></li>
            <li><a href="#when-to-buy">When to buy</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="quick-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Best Treadmill Under $700: The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>Buy the Sunny Health &amp; Fitness SF-T723016 if you want 12% incline and 12 mph from an
            established brand for about $646; buy the Aeriflo X-T510A if you want 20% incline at 12 mph on a
            55-inch deck for about $627; buy the WELLFIT 15% heavy-duty treadmill if anyone in the house
            weighs more than 300 lb.</strong> The ORASANT 18-inch model is the cheapest way to get 12 mph and
            20% incline in one machine, at about $510, and the Schwinn 810 is the pick for the longest motor
            warranty, at the cost of a 10 mph top speed.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>12% incline or more at 12 mph:</strong> Sunny SF-T723016 (12%), Aeriflo X-T510A (20%) and ORASANT (20%), per each listing.</li>
